# The Deploy to Cloudflare button prompts for every UNCOMMENTED line here as a required secret. Never commit real values.
# Owner passphrase: typed on the OAuth approval page (claude.ai / Claude Code connect) and the /owner console.
# Left EMPTY on purpose: the Deploy button pre-fills whatever value is here, so a placeholder would ship as your real secret.
# Generate one: openssl rand -base64 24
OWNER_PASSPHRASE=
# Optional static bearer for headless clients (cron, CI, Codex). Keep commented so the button does not require it;
# enable later with: wrangler secret put MCP_API_TOKEN
# MCP_API_TOKEN=
